@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/shopping-cart-api/api

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Kiểm tra session
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/session

### Danh sách sản phẩm
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### Thêm Laptop
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1
}

### Xem giỏ hàng
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart

### Logout
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/auth/session
